   "Oz Yosef Yohay": {
        "README.md": "<div align='center'>\n<img src='https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wnderoy/portfolio/assets/Artwork.jpg' width='300'>\n\n# Oz Yosef Yohay\n**Software Engineer || Systems Engineer || C++**\n</div>\n\n### Professional Summary\nThird-year Software Engineering BSc student at Afeka College, Tel Aviv.\nExperienced in educational guidance and working with at-risk youth.\nBackend Engineer, Software Verification, C++\n\n### Technical Projects\n\n**Formal Software Verification Pipeline**\n- Building an automated pipeline utilizing Generative AI to produce provably correct code.\n- Designed the system architecture to map high level requirements directly to verified code skeletons.\n\n**Smart Medication Tracking System**\n- Developed a comprehensive system for tracking and verifying medical supplies using Java and MongoDB.\n- Implemented a network architecture handling HTTP requests between the client and server components.\n\n### Work Experience\n\n**Math and Physics Teacher, TeachIn Israel, 2025 - 2026**\n- High school math teacher for grades 7-12, public speaking, and explaining complex topics.\n\n**Tutor, Aloni Yitzhak School Givat Ada (part-time), 2024 - 2025**\n- Group or private lessons for grades 10-12 in the subjects of Mathematics, Computer Science, Software Engineering, and Physics\n\n**Guide in Tnuat Tarbut (Culture Movement), Dimona, 2022-2023**\n- Year of Service: Work in an at-risk youth club, and work in a high school as an art teacher's assistant (Ometz class)\n\n### Education\n\n**Software Engineering BSc, Afeka College Tel Aviv, 2023 to Present**\n- Expected graduation: 2027\n- Specializing in machine learning and AI\n\n**Full matriculation certificate - Ort Haklai Pardes Hanna**\n- 5 Mathematics, 5 English, 5 Physics, 10 Computer Science\n\n### Contact\n- **Location:** Haifa, Relocating\n- **Phone:** 0508253444\n- **Email:** [wnder.oy@gmail.com](mailto:wnder.oy@gmail.com)\n- **GitHub:** [github.com/wnderoy](https://github.com/wnderoy)\n- **Languages:** English (Fluent), Hebrew (Native)"
    },
